# Test data: the folder skeleton and its README are tracked, the data is not.
test_data/**
!test_data/README.md
!test_data/*/
!test_data/*/.gitkeep

# Anchored to the repo root: an unanchored `data/` matches at any depth and
# would silently swallow tracked directories like 03_analysis/data/ (the
# combination tables the reconstruction reads).
/data/

# The plot histograms are tracked alongside the figures they came from: 16 KB of
# TH1F/TH2F, not events, and they let the plots be restyled without re-running
# the event loop. The blanket *.root rule at the top is for detector data.
!06_plots/plots/istogrammi.root